{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "1. Find a comfortable note" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"١. اعثر على نغمة مريحة"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Finde einen angenehmen Ton"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Find a comfortable note"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Encuentra una nota cómoda"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Trouvez une note confortable"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. 無理なく出せる音を探す"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. 편하게 낼 수 있는 음 찾기"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Encontre uma nota confortável"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Найдите удобную ноту"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. Tìm một nốt thoải mái"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. 找到舒适的音"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"1. 找到舒適的音"}}}},
    "2. Play with a steady pulse" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"٢. اعزف بإيقاع ثابت"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. Spiele mit gleichmäßigem Puls"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. Play with a steady pulse"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. Toca con un pulso constante"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. Jouez avec une pulsation régulière"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. 一定の拍で演奏する"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. 일정한 박자로 연주하기"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. Toque com pulsação constante"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. Играйте в ровном ритме"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. Chơi với nhịp đều"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. 跟随稳定节拍演奏"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"2. 跟隨穩定節拍演奏"}}}},
    "A short, offline guide" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"دليل قصير بلا إنترنت"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eine kurze Offline-Anleitung"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A short, offline guide"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Una guía breve sin conexión"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un guide court hors ligne"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"短いオフラインガイド"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"짧은 오프라인 안내"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Um guia curto offline"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Краткое руководство без сети"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hướng dẫn ngắn ngoại tuyến"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"简短的离线指南"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"簡短的離線指南"}}}},
    "Choose a comfortable tempo, start the metronome, and play a short passage. Stop it when you finish." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اختر سرعة مريحة، وشغّل المسرع، واعزف مقطعًا قصيرًا. أوقفه عند الانتهاء."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wähle ein angenehmes Tempo, starte das Metronom und spiele eine kurze Passage. Stoppe es danach."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose a comfortable tempo, start the metronome, and play a short passage. Stop it when you finish."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elige un tempo cómodo, inicia el metrónomo y toca un pasaje breve. Deténlo al terminar."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choisissez un tempo confortable, démarrez le métronome et jouez un court passage. Arrêtez-le à la fin."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無理のないテンポを選んでメトロノームを開始し、短いフレーズを演奏します。終わったら停止します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"편안한 빠르기를 선택하고 메트로놈을 시작한 뒤 짧은 구절을 연주하세요. 끝나면 멈추세요."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escolha um andamento confortável, inicie o metrônomo e toque um trecho curto. Pare-o ao terminar."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Выберите удобный темп, запустите метроном и сыграйте короткий отрывок. Остановите его в конце."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chọn tốc độ thoải mái, bật máy đếm nhịp và chơi một đoạn ngắn. Tắt máy khi hoàn tất."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择舒适的速度，启动节拍器并演奏一小段。完成后停止节拍器。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇舒適的速度，啟動節拍器並演奏一小段。完成後停止節拍器。"}}}},
    "Choose an interval, then press Play. Listen to the two notes, switch temperament, and listen again. Try singing or playing the upper note with the root." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اختر فاصلاً، ثم اضغط تشغيل. استمع إلى النغمتين، وغيّر نظام الضبط، ثم استمع مجددًا. جرّب غناء النغمة العليا أو عزفها مع النغمة الأساسية."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wähle ein Intervall und tippe auf Wiedergabe. Höre beide Töne, wechsle die Stimmung und höre erneut. Singe oder spiele den oberen Ton zum Grundton."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choose an interval, then press Play. Listen to the two notes, switch temperament, and listen again. Try singing or playing the upper note with the root."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Elige un intervalo y pulsa Reproducir. Escucha las dos notas, cambia la afinación y vuelve a escuchar. Prueba a cantar o tocar la nota superior junto con la fundamental."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Choisissez un intervalle, puis lancez la lecture. Écoutez les deux notes, changez de tempérament et écoutez à nouveau. Essayez de chanter ou de jouer la note supérieure avec la fondamentale."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"音程を選んで再生を押します。2音を聴き、音律を切り替えてもう一度聴きます。基音に合わせて上の音を歌うか演奏してみましょう。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"음정을 선택한 다음 재생을 누르세요. 두 음을 듣고 음률을 바꿔 다시 들어 보세요. 기준음에 맞춰 위 음을 노래하거나 연주해 보세요."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escolha um intervalo e toque em Reproduzir. Ouça as duas notas, mude o temperamento e ouça novamente. Experimente cantar ou tocar a nota superior com a fundamental."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Выберите интервал и нажмите воспроизведение. Послушайте обе ноты, смените темперацию и послушайте снова. Попробуйте спеть или сыграть верхнюю ноту вместе с основным тоном."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chọn một quãng rồi nhấn Phát. Nghe hai nốt, đổi hệ điều âm và nghe lại. Hãy thử hát hoặc chơi nốt trên cùng với nốt gốc."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"选择一个音程，然后点击播放。听两音，切换律制后再听一次。试着配合根音唱出或演奏上方的音。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"選擇一個音程，然後點按播放。聆聽兩音，切換律制後再聽一次。試著配合根音唱出或演奏上方的音。"}}}},
    "Compare intervals by ear" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"قارن الفواصل بالسمع"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Intervalle nach Gehör vergleichen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compare intervals by ear"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compara intervalos de oído"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Comparez les intervalles à l’oreille"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"耳で音程を比べる"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"귀로 음정 비교하기"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Compare intervalos de ouvido"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сравните интервалы на слух"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"So sánh quãng bằng tai"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用耳朵比较音程"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"用耳朵比較音程"}}}},
    "Create practice goal" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"إنشاء هدف للتدريب"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Übungsziel erstellen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Create practice goal"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Crear objetivo de práctica"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Créer un objectif de pratique"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"練習目標を作成"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연습 목표 만들기"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Criar meta de prática"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Создать цель занятия"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tạo mục tiêu luyện tập"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"创建练习目标"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"建立練習目標"}}}},
    "Current: %@ BPM · Target: %@ BPM" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الحالي: %@ نبضة/دقيقة · الهدف: %@ نبضة/دقيقة"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aktuell: %@ BPM · Ziel: %@ BPM"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Current: %@ BPM · Target: %@ BPM"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actual: %@ BPM · Objetivo: %@ BPM"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Actuel : %@ BPM · Objectif : %@ BPM"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"現在: %@ BPM · 目標: %@ BPM"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"현재: %@ BPM · 목표: %@ BPM"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Atual: %@ BPM · Meta: %@ BPM"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сейчас: %@ BPM · Цель: %@ BPM"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hiện tại: %@ BPM · Mục tiêu: %@ BPM"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"当前：%@ BPM · 目标：%@ BPM"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目前：%@ BPM · 目標：%@ BPM"}}}},
    "Exit guide" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"إنهاء الدليل"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Anleitung verlassen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Exit guide"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Salir de la guía"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quitter le guide"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"ガイドを終了"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"안내 종료"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sair do guia"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Выйти из руководства"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thoát hướng dẫn"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"退出指南"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"退出指南"}}}},
    "First practice" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"التدرب الأول"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Erste Übung"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"First practice"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Primera práctica"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Première séance"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"最初の練習"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"첫 연습"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Primeira prática"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Первая практика"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Buổi tập đầu tiên"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"第一次练习"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"第一次練習"}}}},
    "Just interval: %@ cents relative to equal temperament." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الفاصل الطبيعي: %@ سنت مقارنة بالضبط المتساوي."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reines Intervall: %@ Cent gegenüber der gleichstufigen Stimmung."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Just interval: %@ cents relative to equal temperament."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Intervalo justo: %@ cents respecto al temperamento igual."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Intervalle juste : %@ cents par rapport au tempérament égal."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"純正音程：平均律に対して%@セント。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"순정 음정: 평균율 대비 %@센트."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Intervalo justo: %@ cents em relação ao temperamento igual."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Чистый интервал: %@ центов относительно равномерной темперации."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Quãng thuần: %@ cent so với bình quân luật."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"纯律音程：相对于平均律为 %@ 音分。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"純律音程：相對於平均律為 %@ 音分。"}}}},
    "Next tempo" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"السرعة التالية"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nächstes Tempo"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Next tempo"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Siguiente tempo"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempo suivant"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"次のテンポ"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"다음 템포"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Próximo andamento"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Следующий темп"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nhịp độ tiếp theo"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下一个速度"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"下一個速度"}}}},
    "Notice one thing that went well and one thing to try next time." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"لاحظ شيئًا سار جيدًا وشيئًا ستجربه في المرة القادمة."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Achte auf eine Sache, die gut lief, und eine, die du nächstes Mal versuchen möchtest."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Notice one thing that went well and one thing to try next time."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Piensa en algo que salió bien y algo que probarás la próxima vez."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Notez une chose réussie et une chose à essayer la prochaine fois."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"うまくいったことと、次回試したいことを一つずつ考えましょう。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"잘된 점 한 가지와 다음에 시도할 점 한 가지를 생각해 보세요."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Observe algo que deu certo e algo para tentar na próxima vez."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Отметьте, что получилось хорошо и что вы попробуете в следующий раз."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ghi nhận một điều đã làm tốt và một điều muốn thử lần sau."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"想一想一件做得好的事，以及下次想尝试的一件事。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"想一想一件做得好的事，以及下次想嘗試的一件事。"}}}},
    "Open tuner" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"افتح الموالف"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stimmgerät öffnen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Open tuner"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abrir afinador"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ouvrir l’accordeur"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"チューナーを開く"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"튜너 열기"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abrir afinador"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Открыть тюнер"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mở bộ chỉnh âm"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"打开调音器"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開啟調音器"}}}},
    "Play a comfortable long note. Open the tuner if you want feedback; start listening only when you are ready." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اعزف نغمة طويلة مريحة. افتح الموالف للحصول على الملاحظات، وابدأ الاستماع عندما تكون مستعدًا."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Spiele einen angenehmen langen Ton. Öffne bei Bedarf das Stimmgerät und starte das Zuhören, sobald du bereit bist."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Play a comfortable long note. Open the tuner if you want feedback; start listening only when you are ready."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toca una nota larga y cómoda. Abre el afinador si quieres comentarios y activa la escucha cuando estés listo."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Jouez une note longue et confortable. Ouvrez l’accordeur pour obtenir un retour et démarrez l’écoute quand vous êtes prêt."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"無理のない長い音を吹きましょう。確認したい場合はチューナーを開き、準備ができたら聴き取りを開始します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"편안한 긴 음을 연주하세요. 피드백이 필요하면 튜너를 열고 준비가 되면 듣기를 시작하세요."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toque uma nota longa e confortável. Abra o afinador para receber feedback e inicie a escuta quando estiver pronto."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Сыграйте удобную длинную ноту. При желании откройте тюнер и включите прослушивание, когда будете готовы."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Chơi một nốt dài thoải mái. Mở bộ chỉnh âm nếu muốn nhận phản hồi và bắt đầu nghe khi bạn sẵn sàng."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"吹奏一个舒适的长音。如需反馈，请打开调音器，准备好后再开始聆听。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"吹奏一個舒適的長音。如需回饋，請開啟調音器，準備好後再開始聆聽。"}}}},
    "Practice complete" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"اكتمل التدريب"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Übung abgeschlossen"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Practice complete"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Práctica completada"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Séance terminée"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"練習完了"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"연습 완료"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prática concluída"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Практика завершена"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã hoàn thành buổi tập"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"练习完成"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"練習完成"}}}},
    "Repeat a tempo or move when you are ready; this does not record an outcome." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"كرر السرعة أو انتقل عندما تكون مستعدًا؛ لا يسجل هذا نتيجة."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wiederhole ein Tempo oder gehe weiter, wenn du bereit bist; dies erfasst kein Ergebnis."}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Repeat a tempo or move when you are ready; this does not record an outcome."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Repite un tempo o avanza cuando estés listo; esto no registra un resultado."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Répétez un tempo ou avancez quand vous êtes prêt ; aucun résultat n'est enregistré."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"テンポを繰り返すか、準備ができたら進みます。結果は記録されません。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"템포를 반복하거나 준비되면 이동하세요. 결과는 기록되지 않습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Repita um andamento ou avance quando estiver pronto; isso não registra um resultado."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Повторяйте темп или переходите дальше, когда будете готовы; результат не записывается."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lặp lại một nhịp độ hoặc chuyển tiếp khi sẵn sàng; thao tác này không ghi kết quả."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"准备好时可重复当前速度或继续；此操作不会记录结果。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"準備好時可重複目前速度或繼續；此操作不會記錄結果。"}}}},
    "Starting tempo: %@ BPM" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سرعة البداية: %@ نبضة/دقيقة"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Starttempo: %@ BPM"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Starting tempo: %@ BPM"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempo inicial: %@ BPM"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempo initial : %@ BPM"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"開始テンポ: %@ BPM"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"시작 템포: %@ BPM"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Andamento inicial: %@ BPM"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Начальный темп: %@ BPM"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nhịp độ bắt đầu: %@ BPM"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"起始速度：%@ BPM"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"起始速度：%@ BPM"}}}},
    "Step back" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"الرجوع خطوة"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schritt zurück"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Step back"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Paso atrás"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Reculer"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"一段戻る"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"한 단계 뒤로"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Voltar um passo"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Шаг назад"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lùi một bước"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"后退一级"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"後退一級"}}}},
    "Tempo ladder" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سُلّم السرعة"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempo-Leiter"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempo ladder"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escalera de tempos"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Échelle de tempos"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"テンポラダー"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"템포 단계"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Escada de andamento"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Лестница темпа"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thang nhịp độ"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"速度阶梯"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"速度階梯"}}}},
    "Tempo step: %@ BPM" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"زيادة السرعة: %@ نبضة/دقيقة"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Temposchritt: %@ BPM"}},"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tempo step: %@ BPM"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incremento de tempo: %@ BPM"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pas de tempo : %@ BPM"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"テンポの刻み: %@ BPM"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"템포 간격: %@ BPM"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Incremento de andamento: %@ BPM"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Шаг темпа: %@ BPM"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Bước nhịp độ: %@ BPM"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"速度步长：%@ BPM"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"速度步長：%@ BPM"}}}},
    "%@ takes / %@ days" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Takes: %@ / Days: %@"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"التسجيلات: %@ / الأيام: %@"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aufnahmen: %@ / Tage: %@"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tomas: %@ / Días: %@"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prises : %@ / Jours : %@"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"テイク：%@回 / 日数：%@日"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"녹음: %@회 / 일수: %@일"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gravações: %@ / Dias: %@"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Записи: %@ / Дни: %@"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Lượt thu: %@ / Số ngày: %@"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"录音次数：%@ / 天数：%@"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"錄音次數：%@ / 天數：%@"}}}},
    "%@ · %@ sustained tone" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ sustained tone"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · نغمة مستدامة %@"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ gehaltener Ton"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ tono sostenido"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ note tenue"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@・%@のロングトーン"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ 롱톤"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ nota sustentada"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ выдержанный тон"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ âm dài"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ 长音"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · %@ 長音"}}}},
    "%@ · spread %@¢ · %@ takes / %@ days" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · spread %@¢ · %@ takes / %@ days"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · نطاق %@¢ · %@ تسجيلات / %@ أيام"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · Streuung %@¢ · %@ Aufnahmen / %@ Tage"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · dispersión %@¢ · %@ tomas / %@ días"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · étendue %@¢ · %@ prises / %@ jours"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@・ばらつき %@¢・%@テイク / %@日"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · 편차 %@¢ · %@회 테이크 / %@일"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · variação %@¢ · %@ tomadas / %@ dias"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · разброс %@¢ · %@ записей / %@ дней"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · độ lệch %@¢ · %@ lượt thu / %@ ngày"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · 波动 %@¢ · %@ 次录音 / %@ 天"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ · 波動 %@¢ · %@ 次錄音 / %@ 天"}}}},
    "A completed sustained-tone goal already exists for %@. Review it in Practice goals before creating another." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A completed sustained-tone goal already exists for %@. Review it in Practice goals before creating another."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يوجد هدف نغمة مستدامة مكتمل بالفعل لـ %@. راجعه في أهداف التدريب قبل إنشاء هدف آخر."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Für %@ gibt es bereits ein abgeschlossenes Ziel für gehaltene Töne. Prüfe es unter Übungsziele, bevor du ein weiteres erstellst."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ya existe un objetivo de tono sostenido completado para %@. Revísalo en Objetivos de práctica antes de crear otro."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un objectif de note tenue terminé existe déjà pour %@. Consultez-le dans Objectifs d'entraînement avant d'en créer un autre."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@には完了済みのロングトーン目標があります。新しい目標を作成する前に、練習目標で確認してください。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@에 대한 완료된 롱톤 목표가 이미 있습니다. 새 목표를 만들기 전에 연습 목표에서 확인하세요."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Já existe uma meta concluída de nota sustentada para %@. Consulte-a em Metas de prática antes de criar outra."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Для %@ уже есть выполненная цель по выдержанному тону. Проверьте её в целях практики, прежде чем создавать новую."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã có mục tiêu âm dài hoàn thành cho %@. Hãy xem trong Mục tiêu luyện tập trước khi tạo mục tiêu khác."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已有一个完成的长音目标。请先在练习目标中查看，再创建新的目标。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已有一個完成的長音目標。請先在練習目標中查看，再建立新的目標。"}}}},
    "A local review of completed live captures for %@ at A4 %@ Hz. Compared with equal temperament; intentional chord tuning can differ. Each take has equal weight." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A local review of completed live captures for %@ at A4 %@ Hz. Compared with equal temperament; intentional chord tuning can differ. Each take has equal weight."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"مراجعة محلية للتسجيلات الحية المكتملة لـ %@ عند A4 %@ Hz. تُقارن بالسلم المعدل المتساوي؛ وقد يختلف ضبط الأوتار المقصود. لكل تسجيل الوزن نفسه."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Eine lokale Auswertung abgeschlossener Live-Aufnahmen für %@ bei A4 %@ Hz. Verglichen mit gleichstufiger Stimmung; bewusstes Akkordstimmen kann abweichen. Jede Aufnahme zählt gleich."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Una revisión local de capturas en vivo completadas para %@ a A4 %@ Hz. Se compara con el temperamento igual; la afinación intencional de acordes puede variar. Cada toma tiene el mismo peso."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Une analyse locale des captures en direct terminées pour %@ à A4 %@ Hz. Comparée au tempérament égal ; l'accordage volontaire des accords peut différer. Chaque prise a le même poids."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A4 %@ Hzでの%@の完了済みライブ録音をローカルで確認します。平均律と比較しています。意図的な和音のチューニングは異なる場合があります。各テイクは同じ重みで扱います。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A4 %@ Hz에서 %@의 완료된 라이브 녹음을 기기에서 검토합니다. 평균율과 비교하며, 의도적인 화음 튜닝은 다를 수 있습니다. 각 테이크의 비중은 같습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uma análise local das capturas ao vivo concluídas para %@ em A4 %@ Hz. Comparada ao temperamento igual; a afinação intencional de acordes pode ser diferente. Cada tomada tem o mesmo peso."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Локальный обзор завершённых живых записей для %@ при A4 %@ Hz. Сравнение с равномерной темперацией; намеренная настройка аккордов может отличаться. Каждая запись имеет одинаковый вес."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đánh giá cục bộ các bản thu trực tiếp đã hoàn thành cho %@ ở A4 %@ Hz. So sánh với hệ chia đều; việc chỉnh hợp âm có chủ ý có thể khác. Mỗi lượt thu có trọng số như nhau."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"对 %@ 在 A4 %@ Hz 下已完成的现场录音进行本地查看。与十二平均律比较；有意的和弦调音可能不同。每次录音权重相同。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"對 %@ 在 A4 %@ Hz 下已完成的現場錄音進行本地查看。與十二平均律比較；有意的和弦調音可能不同。每次錄音權重相同。"}}}},
    "A new goal could not be created because the goal list is full." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"A new goal could not be created because the goal list is full."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تعذر إنشاء هدف جديد لأن قائمة الأهداف ممتلئة."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ein neues Ziel konnte nicht erstellt werden, weil die Zielliste voll ist."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"No se pudo crear un objetivo nuevo porque la lista de objetivos está llena."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Impossible de créer un nouvel objectif, car la liste des objectifs est pleine."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"目標リストがいっぱいのため、新しい目標を作成できませんでした。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"목표 목록이 가득 차서 새 목표를 만들 수 없습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Não foi possível criar uma nova meta porque a lista de metas está cheia."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Не удалось создать новую цель, потому что список целей заполнен."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Không thể tạo mục tiêu mới vì danh sách mục tiêu đã đầy."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由于目标列表已满，无法创建新目标。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"由於目標列表已滿，無法建立新目標。"}}}},
    "Above equal temperament" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Above equal temperament"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أعلى من السلم المعدل المتساوي"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Über gleichstufiger Stimmung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Por encima del temperamento igual"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Au-dessus du tempérament égal"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"平均律より高い"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"평균율보다 높음"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Acima do temperamento igual"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Выше равномерной темперации"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cao hơn hệ chia đều"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高于十二平均律"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"高於十二平均律"}}}},
    "Alternate click bars with silent bars so you keep the pulse internally." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alternate click bars with silent bars so you keep the pulse internally."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"بدّل بين الموازير ذات النقرات والموازير الصامتة لتحافظ على النبض داخليًا."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Wechsle Takte mit Klicks und stille Takte ab, damit du den Puls innerlich hältst."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alterna compases con clics y compases silenciosos para mantener el pulso internamente."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alternez des mesures avec clics et des mesures silencieuses pour garder la pulsation intérieurement."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"クリックのある小節と無音の小節を交互にして、内側で拍を保ちましょう。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"클릭 마디와 무음 마디를 번갈아 사용해 내면으로 박을 유지하세요."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Alterne compassos com clique e silenciosos para manter a pulsação internamente."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Чередуйте такты с кликами и тихие такты, чтобы удерживать пульс внутри."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Xen kẽ ô nhịp có tiếng click và ô nhịp im lặng để giữ nhịp bên trong."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"交替使用有点击声和静音的小节，以便在心中保持节拍。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"交替使用有點擊聲和靜音的小節，以便在心中保持節拍。"}}}},
    "An active sustained-tone goal already exists for %@." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"An active sustained-tone goal already exists for %@."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"يوجد بالفعل هدف نغمة مستدامة نشط لـ %@."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Für %@ gibt es bereits ein aktives Ziel für gehaltene Töne."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ya existe un objetivo activo de tono sostenido para %@."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un objectif actif de note tenue existe déjà pour %@."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@にはすでに進行中のロングトーン目標があります。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@에 대한 활성 롱톤 목표가 이미 있습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Já existe uma meta ativa de nota sustentada para %@."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Для %@ уже есть активная цель по выдержанному тону."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã có mục tiêu âm dài đang hoạt động cho %@."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已有一个进行中的长音目标。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@ 已有一個進行中的長音目標。"}}}},
    "Below equal temperament" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Below equal temperament"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أدنى من السلم المعدل المتساوي"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Unter gleichstufiger Stimmung"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Por debajo del temperamento igual"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Au-dessous du tempérament égal"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"平均律より低い"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"평균율보다 낮음"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Abaixo do temperamento igual"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ниже равномерной темперации"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Thấp hơn hệ chia đều"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"低于十二平均律"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"低於十二平均律"}}}},
    "Centered or mixed" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Centered or mixed"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"متمركز أو مختلط"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zentriert oder gemischt"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Centrado o mixto"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Centré ou mixte"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"中央または混在"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"중심 또는 혼합"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Centralizado ou misto"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"По центру или смешанно"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ở giữa hoặc lẫn lộn"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"居中或混合"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"居中或混合"}}}},
    "Clicks" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clicks"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نقرات"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Klicks"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clics"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Clics"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"クリック"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"클릭"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cliques"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Клики"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tiếng click"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"点击声"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"點擊聲"}}}},
    "Complete live tuning captures for this instrument and A4 setting to build a note-by-note review." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Complete live tuning captures for this instrument and A4 setting to build a note-by-note review."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"أكمل تسجيلات ضبط حية لهذه الآلة وإعداد A4 لبناء مراجعة نغمة بنغمة."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Schließe Live-Stimmaufnahmen für dieses Instrument und diese A4-Einstellung ab, um eine Note-für-Note-Auswertung zu erstellen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Completa capturas de afinación en vivo para este instrumento y ajuste de A4 para crear una revisión nota por nota."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Terminez des captures d'accordage en direct pour cet instrument et ce réglage A4 afin de créer une analyse note par note."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"この楽器とA4設定でライブチューニング録音を完了し、音ごとの確認を作成します。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이 악기와 A4 설정으로 라이브 튜닝 녹음을 완료하면 음별 검토를 만들 수 있습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Conclua capturas de afinação ao vivo para este instrumento e ajuste de A4 para criar uma análise nota a nota."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Завершите живые записи настройки для этого инструмента и настройки A4, чтобы создать обзор по каждой ноте."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Hoàn thành các bản thu chỉnh âm trực tiếp cho nhạc cụ này và cài đặt A4 để tạo đánh giá từng nốt."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成此乐器和 A4 设置的现场调音录音，以生成逐音查看。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"完成此樂器和 A4 設定的現場調音錄音，以產生逐音查看。"}}}},
    "Created an explore goal for %@. You can review it in Practice goals." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Created an explore goal for %@. You can review it in Practice goals."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"تم إنشاء هدف استكشافي لـ %@. يمكنك مراجعته في أهداف التدريب."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ein Erkundungsziel für %@ wurde erstellt. Du kannst es unter Übungsziele prüfen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Se creó un objetivo de exploración para %@. Puedes revisarlo en Objetivos de práctica."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Un objectif d'exploration a été créé pour %@. Vous pouvez le consulter dans Objectifs d'entraînement."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@の探索目標を作成しました。練習目標で確認できます。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%@에 대한 탐색 목표를 만들었습니다. 연습 목표에서 확인할 수 있습니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Uma meta de exploração para %@ foi criada. Você pode consultá-la em Metas de prática."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Создана цель для изучения %@. Её можно просмотреть в целях практики."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Đã tạo mục tiêu khám phá cho %@. Bạn có thể xem trong Mục tiêu luyện tập."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已为 %@ 创建探索目标。你可以在练习目标中查看。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"已為 %@ 建立探索目標。你可以在練習目標中查看。"}}}},
    "Evidence window: the last 30 calendar days. A recurring tendency needs at least 3 qualifying takes across 2 days." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Evidence window: the last 30 calendar days. A recurring tendency needs at least 3 qualifying takes across 2 days."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"نافذة الأدلة: آخر 30 يومًا تقويميًا. يحتاج الاتجاه المتكرر إلى 3 تسجيلات مؤهلة على يومين على الأقل."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Evidenzzeitraum: die letzten 30 Kalendertage. Eine wiederkehrende Tendenz benötigt mindestens 3 qualifizierende Aufnahmen an 2 Tagen."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ventana de evidencia: los últimos 30 días naturales. Una tendencia recurrente necesita al menos 3 tomas válidas en 2 días."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Fenêtre d'observation : les 30 derniers jours calendaires. Une tendance récurrente nécessite au moins 3 prises qualifiantes sur 2 jours."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"証拠期間：直近30日間。繰り返す傾向には、2日以上にわたる少なくとも3件の条件を満たすテイクが必要です。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"근거 기간: 최근 30일. 반복 경향으로 판단하려면 2일에 걸쳐 조건을 충족하는 테이크가 최소 3회 필요합니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Janela de evidência: os últimos 30 dias corridos. Uma tendência recorrente precisa de pelo menos 3 tomadas qualificadas em 2 dias."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Окно данных: последние 30 календарных дней. Для повторяющейся тенденции нужны как минимум 3 подходящие записи за 2 дня."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Khoảng bằng chứng: 30 ngày lịch gần nhất. Một xu hướng lặp lại cần ít nhất 3 lượt thu đủ điều kiện trong 2 ngày."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"证据窗口：最近 30 个自然日。要判定为反复趋势，至少需要在 2 天内有 3 次符合条件的录音。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"證據視窗：最近 30 個日曆日。要判定為反覆趨勢，至少需要在 2 天內有 3 次符合條件的錄音。"}}}},
