    "More evidence needed before calling this a recurring tendency." : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"More evidence needed before calling this a recurring tendency."}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"هناك حاجة إلى مزيد من الأدلة قبل اعتبار هذا اتجاهًا متكررًا."}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Es werden mehr Daten benötigt, bevor dies als wiederkehrende Tendenz gilt."}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Se necesita más evidencia antes de considerarlo una tendencia recurrente."}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Davantage de données sont nécessaires avant de qualifier cela de tendance récurrente."}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"これを繰り返す傾向と判断するには、さらに記録が必要です。"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"이를 반복 경향으로 판단하려면 추가 근거가 필요합니다."}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"São necessárias mais evidências antes de considerar isso uma tendência recorrente."}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Нужно больше данных, прежде чем считать это повторяющейся тенденцией."}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Cần thêm bằng chứng trước khi gọi đây là một xu hướng lặp lại."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在将其称为反复趋势之前，需要更多证据。"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"在將其稱為反覆趨勢之前，需要更多證據。"}}}},
