    "Record take" : {"localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Record take"}},"ar":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"سجل خذ"}},"de":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aufnahme aufnehmen"}},"es":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Toma de registro"}},"fr":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prise d'enregistrement"}},"ja":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"レコードテイク"}},"ko":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"녹음 테이크"}},"pt-BR":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Gravar tomada"}},"ru":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Запись дубля"}},"vi":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ghi lại"}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"录音拍摄"}},"zh-Hant":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"錄音拍攝"}}}} ,
